# ─── HOW TO FIND YOUR PC IP ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Open CMD → run: ipconfig
# Look for "IPv4 Address" under your WiFi adapter, e.g. 192.168.1.5
# Replace BOTH values below with that IP
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# adb reverse setup (USB cable) — run once in terminal:
#   adb reverse tcp:8081 tcp:8081
#   adb reverse tcp:5000 tcp:5000
# Then localhost on the device tunnels to your PC.
API_URL=http://192.168.100.16:5000/api

# WiFi alternative (no USB needed) — replace x.x with your actual IP from ipconfig:
# API_URL=http://192.168.x.x:5000/api
# REACT_NATIVE_PACKAGER_HOSTNAME=192.168.x.x